@startuml Sequence Flow 2: Manual Query

title Sequence Flow: Manual Log Query Process

actor "Support Staff" as U
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Backend API" as API
database "SQL Server" as DB

U -> UI: Submit log query
UI -> API: Send query parameters
API -> DB: Fetch logs
DB -->> API: Return log data
API -->> UI: Return log data
UI -->> U: Display log table
@enduml